					  <div class="book_description_middle">
						<p class="description">
								 <p>Through a fun read‑along challenge, kids learn to take charge of their thoughts with God&#8217;s word. I Have the Mind of Jesus is a beautiful children&#8217;s book that helps children manage the thoughts, images, and ideas that pop up in their minds every day using God&#8217;s word. Through a read-along challenge, children learn to speak God’s truth to their thoughts. The messages guide them in using God&#8217;s word to pay attention to their thinking and guard their minds.</p>
