						<div class="book_header">
							<h2><a href="https://freekidsbooks.org/scary-no-more-a-halloween-tale/">Scary No More – A Halloween tale</a></h2>
							<p class="author"><a href="https://freekidsbooks.org/author/danielle-bruckert/" target="_blank">Free Kids Books</a>  </p>                    
