							<p class="age_group">Categories: <a href="https://freekidsbooks.org/subject/activities-and-crafts/" rel="category tag">Activities and Crafts</a>, <a href="https://freekidsbooks.org/age-group/stories-age-6-9-year-olds/" rel="category tag">Age 6-9 years</a>, <a href="https://freekidsbooks.org/all-fkb-books/" rel="category tag">All FKB Books</a>, <a href="https://freekidsbooks.org/reading-level/children/" rel="category tag">Children</a>, <a href="https://freekidsbooks.org/subject/colouring/" rel="category tag">Colouring</a>, <a href="https://freekidsbooks.org/subject/games_activities/" rel="category tag">Games and Activities</a>, <a href="https://freekidsbooks.org/subject/travel-and-geography/" rel="category tag">Geography and Travel</a>, <a href="https://freekidsbooks.org/grade/grade-1-to-grade-3/" rel="category tag">Grade 1 to Grade 3</a>, <a href="https://freekidsbooks.org/author/i-love-colouring/" rel="category tag">I Love Colouring</a></p>
