					  <div class="book_description_middle">
						<p class="description">
								 <p>A fun and educational colouring book with 96 national flags from 6 continents. Each page shows the real flag in colour, the capital city, and a fun fact about the flag, with a big outline flag to colour. It also includes a &#8220;Flag Passport&#8221; where kids tick off every flag they colour, a &#8220;Design Your Own Flag&#8221; page and an A-Z index of countries. The book is made for ages 5-12 and works well for geography lessons, homeschool, and classrooms. </p>
