						<div class="book_header">
							<h2><a href="https://freekidsbooks.org/wally-the-werewolf-learns-patience/">Wally the Werewolf Learns Patience</a></h2>
							<p class="author"><a href="http://meekdukebooks.com/" target="_blank">Timothy LaDuke</a>  </p>                    
