						<p class="description">
								 <p>Wally is a young werewolf who must learn patience before the full moon — a gentle, fun picture-book story.</p>
<p>Published in th Meekduke SeeMore Format (designed for neurodivergent readers); also free as anaudiobook and captioned read-aloud.</p>
