		<div class="col-xs-12 col-sm-12 col-md-9">
					<div class="book_description">
						<div class="book_header">
							<h2><a href="https://freekidsbooks.org/5-scary-stories-from-edgar-allen-poe-halloween-special-feature/">5 Scary Stories from Edgar Allan Poe &#8211; Halloween special feature</a></h2>
							<p class="author"><a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Edgar_Allan_Poe" target="_blank">Edgar Allen Poe</a>  </p>                    
						</div>
