					  <div class="book_description_middle">
						<p class="description">
								 <p>Bino Dino is a friendly dinosaur who loves to explore, make new friends, and discover new places. He enjoys adventure, never gives up, is always kind, and believes in big dreams. Colour in with Bino Dino and his friends in this fun packed 50 page colouring book.</p>
