					  <div class="book_description_middle">
						<p class="description">
								 <p>Rescue Kitty is a heartwarming tale of a young boy who finds a stray calico cat lurking around his house one evening. When she darts away, he wonders if she will return. The next day, he discovers her perched on a woodpile, but she doesn&#8217;t look so well. Mom steps in to help. Then they find another surprise when a storm sets in, and Cally becomes frantic. Mom and son soon come to the rescue!</p>
