						<div class="book_header">
							<h2><a href="https://freekidsbooks.org/the-hunt-for-h-g-growmore/">The Hunt for H.G. Growmore</a></h2>
							<p class="author"><a href="https://www.ninetyninepages.online/stories/the-hunt-for-h-g-growmore" target="_blank">Written By Joshua Kalu Ephraim Illustrated By Joshua-Philip Okeafor</a>  </p>                    
