					<div class="book_description">
						<div class="book_header">
							<h2><a href="https://freekidsbooks.org/milo-and-pip-and-the-secret-waves-of-sound/">Milo and Pip and the Secret Waves of Sound</a></h2>
							<p class="author"><a href="https://www.amazon.com/stores/TRAN-LE-CHAN/author/B0HFCDS4P5?ref=ap_rdr&amp;shoppingPortalEnabled=true&amp;ccs_id=46ac6561-ca4e-4cb4-86b6-db3020230378" target="_blank">Tran Le Chan</a>  </p>                    
						</div>
