					  <div class="book_description_middle">
						<p class="description">
								 <p>Curious Milo and her robot cat Pip explore sound waves in this fun STEM comic. Learn how sound travels through different mediums and sources. What makes sound, how does it travel through different mediums, can you feel sound? Find out in this fun adventure.</p>
