					<div class="book_description">
						<div class="book_header">
							<h2><a href="https://freekidsbooks.org/pam-pams-little-book-of-courage-and-kindness/">Pam Pam&#8217;s Little Book of Courage and Kindness</a></h2>
							<p class="author"><a href="https://www.facebook.com/LoveTailsGentlePaws" target="_blank">Hania Khan</a>  </p>                    
