						<p class="description">
								 <p>Soccerwild is a powerful and uplifting middle-grade novel that weaves together the thrill of the game with the complexities of grief, family, and healing. Written in prose it gives vivid snapshots of the main character&#8217;s thinking as he recovers from trauma.</p>
