					<div class="book_description">
						<div class="book_header">
							<h2><a href="https://freekidsbooks.org/mystery-adventures-for-kids-exciting-tales-for-young-explorers/">Mystery Adventures for Kids: Exciting Tales for Young Explorers</a></h2>
							<p class="author"><a href="https://www.amazon.com/author/warrenrice" target="_blank">Warren Rice</a>  </p>                    
