					  <div class="book_description_middle">
						<p class="description">
								 <p>A fun and spooky collection of nine kid‑friendly mysteries perfect for young readers. Each story begins with something ordinary — a strange door, a quiet hallway, a shadow that moves — and twists into a surprising ending that keeps kids guessing.</p>
<p>From warnings about doors that must never be opened to shadows that crawl across the walls, from mysterious seeds to strange footprints that appear overnight, every tale offers just the right amount of suspense without ever being too scary. These stories are filled with imagination, adventure, and clever surprises that spark curiosity and encourage young readers to think, wonder, and explore.</p>
