							<p class="age_group">Categories: <a href="https://freekidsbooks.org/subject/bedtime-stories/10-minute-bedtime-stories/" rel="category tag">10 to 15 minute bedtime stories</a>, <a href="https://freekidsbooks.org/age-group/stories-age-2-5-years/" rel="category tag">Age 2-5 Years</a>, <a href="https://freekidsbooks.org/age-group/stories-age-6-9-year-olds/" rel="category tag">Age 6-9 years</a>, <a href="https://freekidsbooks.org/all-fkb-books/" rel="category tag">All FKB Books</a>, <a href="https://freekidsbooks.org/subject/animals/" rel="category tag">Animals</a>, <a href="https://freekidsbooks.org/subject/bedtime-stories/" rel="category tag">Bedtime Stories</a>, <a href="https://freekidsbooks.org/subject/animals/birds/" rel="category tag">birds</a>, <a href="https://freekidsbooks.org/grade/grade-1-to-grade-3/" rel="category tag">Grade 1 to Grade 3</a>, <a href="https://freekidsbooks.org/english_level_esl/intermediate-english/" rel="category tag">Intermediate English</a></p>
