					  <div class="book_description_middle">
						<p class="description">
								 <p>Mara helps a small owl collect the quiet pieces of night around her room without pretending the dark feels easy. Mara and the Owl Who Misplaced the Dark is a gentle 670-word bedtime read-aloud for ages 4-7. The 11-page free edition includes a printable owl coloring page and space to draw your own illustrations.</p>
